{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiles of war is a turn-based strategy / tactics game, where you can capture every territory.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/fa6817cf8b603e7ab69598cf67fe2518.avif?t=1756385698\" width=1310 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by timeless classics, Tiles of war takes tactics games to the next level, by letting you capture all territories on the map!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a side and use your units wisely to dominate the map, leading your faction to victory!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The war was supposed to be over.</strong>\u00a0When the  king and queen of the undead suddenly vanished, peace should have followed - but instead, a new war has begun. Their Princess marches against the human kingdom, and only you can stop her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/31b200c8dc04e51f39400aadf9fd4c4b.poster.avif?t=1756385698\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/31b200c8dc04e51f39400aadf9fd4c4b.webm?t=1756385698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/31b200c8dc04e51f39400aadf9fd4c4b.mp4?t=1756385698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture territories</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole map is capture-able, and infantry can capture even more by surrounding tiles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/468e85ee3bfcc72d6ba03db5c815f382.poster.avif?t=1756385698\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/468e85ee3bfcc72d6ba03db5c815f382.webm?t=1756385698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/468e85ee3bfcc72d6ba03db5c815f382.mp4?t=1756385698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factions and Commanders</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans, Undead and Elves are pitching their best leaders, who will be the last one standing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/a14f25a6ec4c8aa721a5150f820142ee.poster.avif?t=1756385698\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/a14f25a6ec4c8aa721a5150f820142ee.webm?t=1756385698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/a14f25a6ec4c8aa721a5150f820142ee.mp4?t=1756385698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unit variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 unit types to take control of the sea, sky and ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/57104c6bdee5cfd397d575127479eb15.poster.avif?t=1756385698\" width=500 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354240/extras/57104c6bdee5cfd397d575127479eb15.webm?t=1756385698\" ty